Subject: [PATCH 18/65] Rename MenuItem to CokMenuItem: it clashes with
 Intuition on SAS/C

intuition/intuition.h already declares struct MenuItem (SAS/C error 63).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
